{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14928","headline":"过楼观李尊师 · 卢纶","name":"过楼观李尊师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城阙望烟霞，常悲仙路赊。\n宁知樵子径，得到葛洪家。\n犬吠松间月，人行洞里花。\n留诗千岁鹤，送客五云车。\n访世山空在，观棋日未斜。\n不知尘俗士，谁解种胡麻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14928.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14928","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}